From: MonsterROM_NEXT <monsterrom@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the primary framework dex within its method ID limit

The beta fills all 65536 method IDs in its first framework dex. The game
launch hook adds a reference there. Move ActivityMonitor unchanged into the
last framework dex, which has room for the class and its public methods.

diff --git a/smali/android/app/Instrumentation$ActivityMonitor.smali b/smali_classes7/android/app/Instrumentation$ActivityMonitor.smali
similarity index 100%
rename from smali/android/app/Instrumentation$ActivityMonitor.smali
rename to smali_classes7/android/app/Instrumentation$ActivityMonitor.smali
